g/t/p/original/yjzt9K0guO54ZWyhRuU3xTYVSTN.jpg"},{"id":1875079,"name":"Elly Han","role":"Vanessa","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dS05gmQ7DFlPwgTb2rEQ1SJlayZ.jpg"},{"id":1382011,"name":"Carol Anne Watts","role":"Cop #2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wgNEIRpOAJGL4GlMypxpZwRpiWp.jpg"},{"id":1717505,"name":"Tyra Colar","role":"Cop #1","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyD7FwZrP3ju5VQFzfPsMq4BjWU.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Supercool - Strafigo per un giorno","overview":"I migliori amici, Neil e Gilbert, iniziano l'ultimo anno di liceo con grandi speranze e aspirazioni. Neil ha sempre fantasticato di essere abbastanza figo da uscire con la sua cotta di lunga data e Gilbert ha sempre sognato di essere una super star dei social media. Dopo quello che, a detta di tutti, è un primo giorno di scuola molto deludente e imbarazzante, Neil esprime il desiderio magico di essere figo proprio nel momento magico in cui l'orologio segna le 11.11. La mattina dopo, Neil si sveglia in una realtà che proviene direttamente dai fumetti dei suoi sogni."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Best friends, Neil and Gilbert start their senior year of high school with high hopes and aspirations. Neil has always fantasized about being cool enough to date his long time crush and Gilbert has always dreamed of being a social media super star. After what is, by all accounts, a very disappointing and embarrassing first day in school, Neil makes a magical wish to be cool just at the magical moment when the clock strikes 11:11. The next morning, Neil wakes up to a reality that is straight from the comics of his dreams.","tagline":"One cool wish is all it takes"},{"language":"fi-FI","overview":"Parhaiden ystävysten seniorivuosi high schoolissa alkaa kuin mikä tahansa vuosi: Gilbert unelmoi supertähteydestä somessa ja Neil toivoisi olevansa tarpeeksi cool deittaillakseen pitkäaikaista ihastustaan Summeria. Kun ensimmäisen koulupäivän kohtaaminen Summerin kanssa huipentuu supernolosti, esittää Neil jälleen kerran universumille toiveensa olla cool – tällä kertaa juuri taianomaisella hetkellä kellon lyödessä 11:11. Seuraavana aamuna Neil herää todellisuuteen, joka on suoraan hänen haaveidensa sarjakuvista."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3NV278UG4Z8wOWpKFHz6I7D7Nda.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iamS2MqyuJCuNDCly3Mrr5Mlw5T.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":514466,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fi-FI","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3NV278UG4Z8wOWpKFHz6I7D7Nda.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3NV278UG4Z8wOWpKFHz6I7D7Nda.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3NV278UG4Z8wOWpKFHz6I7D7Nda.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3NV278UG4Z8wOWpKFHz6I7D7Nda.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ra2Xj1Zeare8p1iamCdk0IdJ5Eo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ra2Xj1Zeare8p1iamCdk0IdJ5Eo.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eMALaOVbuQld4IxFXDTqjOFUDSX.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eMALaOVbuQld4IxFXDTqjOFUDSX.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yMqUj5wwv6jRN0zPYXRBD8fKy9F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yMqUj5wwv6jRN0zPYXRBD8fKy9F.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eix2eZsm9yy6FR6DoH29OX3sWu7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.t